<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Evander Q2 distrib income tumbles.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Evander Q2 distrib income tumbles.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Distrib income			    2.61 vs 32.81</p>
<p>    Capital spending			 10.86 vs 8.76</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			 4,961 vs 4,930</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		875,000 vs 874,000</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			     5.7 vs 5.6</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  48,372 vs 46,633</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     49,301 vs 50,983</p>
<p>Full name: Evander Gold Mines Ltd, part of Gengold Ltd.</p>
